@startuml
title Legacy Notaire Architecture — Monolithic Java Swing
left to right direction

actor "Notary (Escribano)" as User

package "Java Swing monolith" {
  [Java Swing GUI] as GUI
  [Business Logic Classes] as BL
  [JDBC Data Access] as DA
  [JasperReports Engine] as Rpt
}

database "MySQL 5.7" as DB
file "Local PDF Files" as PDF

User --> GUI : Desktop interaction
GUI --> BL : UI events
BL --> DA : Direct SQL queries
DA --> DB : JDBC
BL --> Rpt : Report generation
Rpt --> PDF : Local files

note right of GUI
  Everything runs in a single JVM process.
  There is no real layer split.
  There is no REST API and no authentication.
end note
@enduml
